            value: "Hark! The darkness fills this valley: orcs. More than even my light can purify! Our crossing will be difficult, yet cross we must, if the dwarven caverns we wish to exit.",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "harper_message",
            value: "There’s orcs here; lots of orcs. More than we can fight, I’m thinkin’. But we’ve gots to get through if’n we want to get out o’ these dwarf tunnels!",
            mode: "value",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "konrad_message",
            value: "There are orcs here; many orcs, likely more than we can defeat. Yet we must pass through this valley if we wish to exit the dwarven caverns.",
            mode: "value",
