        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("You’re making for the dwarven caves? I heard the masters say the central gate’s been collapsed for years — them dwarves did it to keep orcs out. Maybe you could come up from underground through there, if you had time to clear a path. But there’s no way down."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("They tried to knock down the eastern mineshaft too, but its since been cleared. Lots o’ orcs and trolls go in, trying to finish off the last dwarves and claim Knalga’s treasure for themselves. That’s the only way underground now."),
          },
          {
